        "id": 139660,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T02:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>By Any Means would be destroyed, since while the card is in play, the \"target\" is not. A similar thing happens when Imbued Vitality is out. If you put a Bounty on an Ongoing, then Imbued Vitatlity leaved play, the target left play, and the bounty would be destroyed.</p><p>Cards under other cards, do not have any keywords, they do not have anything on the front of the card at all. What keeps them a hero, villain, or environment card are the backs which don't change.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:16:25.852Z",
